        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.16.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gus 16:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.26.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "26:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi muze munezererwe iyo misi mikuru, mwe n’abahungu banyu n’abakobga banyu, n’abagurano banyu n’abaguranokazi banyu, n’ Abalewi, n’inyambukīra, n’impfuvyi n’abapfakazi bar’ i wanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyo misi ukw ar’ indwi muze muyigire mikuru yo kuninahaza Uhoraho Imana yanyu muri ha hantu azoba yātoranije; kuk’ Uhoraho Imana yanyu azoba yabahaye umugisha mu myimbu yanyu yose, no mu bikorwa vyose mwakoze, kandi muzoba munezerewe rwose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.23.14+EXO.23.15+EXO.23.16+EXO.23.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuv 23:14-17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haze harenguke izinamuhungu wese imbere y’Uhoraho Imana yanyu gatatu‐gatatu mu mwaka, barenguke ha hantu azoba yātoranije. Baze mu misi mikuru y’imitsima itambiwe, no ku musi ukurikira ya masabato ndwi, no mu misi mikuru y’insāgo; ariko ntibaze barenguke imbere y’ Uhoraho iminwe misa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
