        {
          "text": "Ivy’ ukuri, mber’ ivy’ ukuri vyonyene abe ari vyo mutumbera mu guca imanza, kugira ngo mubone kubaho, mugume muri ca gihugu mwashikiriye, ico Uhoraho Imana yanyu yabahaye.",
